body:
@jitspoe If you could thoroughly test #118155 with your own character controller, to make sure there are no regressions in terms of weird collision results, that would be a good first step to getting it merged I guess.

I'll see if I can find some time (in the coming days/weeks) to dig up some of the problematic `move_and_slide` cases I ran into back when I worked on the extension, and run that PR through them.

If anyone is aware of (or can find) any sort of comprehensive character controller "gym" anywhere, I'd love to know. I've used [this one](https://github.com/fabriceci/3d-platform-test-for-godot4) in the past, but it's not super comprehensive, and has bitrotted pretty badly.
